{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>ולמען ייטב לך</b> It is an addition over the earlier versions, meaning: if you honor them, HaShem will give you yet further good reward. And since the earlier ones lack the letter tet, it writes 'ולמען' in order to complete in them all the alef-bet letters, simple and doubled."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:51:49.106999581Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}